# Git line-ending policy for data pins.
#
# Every committed aggregate under data/ carries its own SHA-256 in a neighbouring *.meta.json
# sidecar; tests and CI compare those hashes byte-for-byte (docs/205, docs/236).  A checkout-time
# CRLF conversion would silently change the bytes and break the pin, so these paths are explicitly
# marked as text-free: git stores and checks them out verbatim on every platform.
data/oil/*.csv -text
data/oil/*.meta.json -text
data/public/*.csv -text
data/public/*.meta.json -text
